Reverend Warden Manuel de la Cruzada is a hobgoblin with dark blue skin and blue eyes, dressed all in black with black gloves and a gold chain carrying the Scale's symbol. He wears a wide flat-topped hat with a broad brim, and a curled mustache. The right side of his face is badly burnt, and the scars run on down his body. He carries a long-hafted guisarme.

He prays at length under his breath before going into danger.

Manuel is a high-ranking delving specialist of [[Org/The Scale/index|The Scale]], sent with three others to a Joker World at [[Geography/Star 221,325|Star 221,325]].
